1
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,840
[Piyarak Hospital]

2
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,995
Hey, how is Pun?

3
00:01:32,995 --> 00:01:34,976
He's safe. How is Boat?

4
00:01:34,976 --> 00:01:36,960
He's safe, too.

5
00:01:36,960 --> 00:01:38,843
But the doctor wanted to check his brain.

6
00:01:38,843 --> 00:01:41,200
- His brain?
- Sure, let's do it.

7
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:44,994
I'll take care of their medical bills.

8
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:51,011
I need to talk to the nurses.

9
00:01:51,011 --> 00:01:53,448
I'll ask them about the rooms.

10
00:01:53,448 --> 00:01:54,839
Okay.

11
00:02:00,464 --> 00:02:02,155
Can I talk to you?

12
00:02:02,155 --> 00:02:03,259
Come here.

13
00:02:03,259 --> 00:02:04,722
What is it?

14
00:02:06,283 --> 00:02:08,149
I just talked to the police.

15
00:02:08,149 --> 00:02:10,544
They said
that they're also working on Ginny's case.

16
00:02:10,544 --> 00:02:16,901
They asked me a lot of questions
about you and Ginny.

17
00:02:16,901 --> 00:02:20,269
Like, were you two close?
Did you work together in many projects?

18
00:02:20,269 --> 00:02:22,349
They also asked about Wee.

19
00:02:23,093 --> 00:02:24,619
Why did they ask about Wee?

20
00:02:24,619 --> 00:02:26,875
Ginny took her English courses in New York.

21
00:02:26,875 --> 00:02:31,529
And it was the same time
that Wee was in the US.

22
00:02:33,752 --> 00:02:36,853
Thai people fly to the US all the time.

23
00:02:39,773 --> 00:02:45,469
Wee attended a seminar in LA,
I think he's safe.

24
00:02:45,469 --> 00:02:48,913
I heard the makeup artists talking,

25
00:02:48,913 --> 00:02:51,277
and they said that Ginny dated a politician.

26
00:02:51,277 --> 00:02:53,579
I don't know who he was.

27
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,677
[Piyarak Hospital]

28
00:03:05,677 --> 00:03:07,478
Thank you.

29
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:12,227
I took care of them already.

30
00:03:12,227 --> 00:03:13,432
Thank you.

31
00:03:13,432 --> 00:03:16,333
So, did the doctor check on you?

32
00:03:16,333 --> 00:03:18,216
Oh my goodness!

33
00:03:18,216 --> 00:03:20,485
I was worried about them
and I forgot about you.

34
00:03:20,485 --> 00:03:21,829
You should go to see a doctor.

35
00:03:21,829 --> 00:03:23,815
It's okay, I didn't hurt much.

36
00:03:23,815 --> 00:03:25,221
It was just a few bruises.

37
00:03:25,221 --> 00:03:27,549
- You should see a doctor.
- Yeah, you should.

38
00:03:28,219 --> 00:03:30,784
And I want you to spend a night
at the hospital.

39
00:03:30,784 --> 00:03:32,427
So you don't have to talk to the reporters.

40
00:03:32,427 --> 00:03:35,309
Domino should talk to the reporters.

41
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:39,517
I will guide you on what you can say.

42
00:03:41,845 --> 00:03:46,269
I don't want to be in news
quite often lately.

43
00:03:46,269 --> 00:03:48,240
I'm campaigning at the moment.

44
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:52,429
My family doesn't want you
to get caught in any trouble.

45
00:03:54,715 --> 00:03:56,191
Sure.

46
00:03:59,931 --> 00:04:04,869
About the guy who came to rescue you...

47
00:04:08,645 --> 00:04:12,909
His timing is just too perfect, isn't it?

48
00:04:14,429 --> 00:04:17,592
Are you sure
that he has nothing to do with it?

49
00:04:17,592 --> 00:04:21,460
From my experience, most of the time,

50
00:04:22,349 --> 00:04:24,488
a hero doesn't always just appear like that.

51
00:04:24,488 --> 00:04:26,289
I think it could be a marketing gimmick.

52
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:29,192
It's marketing.

53
00:04:29,192 --> 00:04:30,749
Wee.

54
00:04:30,749 --> 00:04:34,293
You really think
that he was working with the stalker?

55
00:04:34,293 --> 00:04:36,282
Why would he do that for? It...

56
00:04:36,282 --> 00:04:39,232
I just want to do a background check on him

57
00:04:39,232 --> 00:04:40,574
to see if he has something to do with it.

58
00:04:40,574 --> 00:04:42,475
If not, then fine.

59
00:04:42,475 --> 00:04:46,749
I just started on my campaign
and anything could happen.

60
00:04:48,904 --> 00:04:50,212
Sure.

61
00:04:51,008 --> 00:04:52,384
Good.

62
00:04:53,752 --> 00:04:55,656
Please take care of Eva.

63
00:04:55,656 --> 00:04:56,733
You got it.

64
00:04:56,733 --> 00:04:58,749
Let's see a doctor, come on.

65
00:04:58,749 --> 00:05:00,851
I'll take care of her.

66
00:05:00,851 --> 00:05:02,929
Is it hurting anywhere?

67
00:05:10,568 --> 00:05:12,771
Please take care of Eva.

68
00:05:12,771 --> 00:05:15,109
Give her the best special treatment.

69
00:05:15,841 --> 00:05:17,989
Sure, thank you.

70
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,109
Mr. Weechana, please wait.

71
00:05:30,069 --> 00:05:33,229
I am Police Captain Ekachai.

72
00:05:33,229 --> 00:05:37,269
From Pathumwan Station?
You're taking care of Ginny's case?

73
00:05:38,253 --> 00:05:39,493
Yes, sir.

74
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:43,355
I need to ask you a few questions, sir.

75
00:05:43,355 --> 00:05:46,587
How can I contact you?

76
00:05:46,587 --> 00:05:49,557
You can make an appointment
through my secretary.

77
00:05:49,557 --> 00:05:52,203
I'm willing to cooperate.

78
00:05:52,203 --> 00:05:56,494
But I wasn't there when Eva was attacked.

79
00:05:56,494 --> 00:05:58,295
You should know about it.

80
00:05:59,024 --> 00:06:00,955
With all due respect, sir,

81
00:06:00,955 --> 00:06:04,336
I will be asking questions
regarding the death of Ginny.

82
00:06:04,336 --> 00:06:06,709
This is not about Eva's case.

83
00:06:08,176 --> 00:06:10,949
You might know Ginny from a different aspect.

84
00:06:10,949 --> 00:06:14,469
And it could benefit her case.

85
00:06:17,524 --> 00:06:19,390
I don't know what you are talking about,

86
00:06:20,115 --> 00:06:21,916
but you can make an appointment.

87
00:06:37,744 --> 00:06:40,213
- Hi.
- Hi, how are you doing?

88
00:06:40,213 --> 00:06:41,973
Are you feeling better?

89
00:06:41,973 --> 00:06:43,765
I'm okay.

90
00:06:43,765 --> 00:06:48,579
Mr. Weechana will take care
of all your medical expenses.

91
00:06:48,579 --> 00:06:50,317
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

92
00:06:50,317 --> 00:06:53,176
Let me know if you need anything.

93
00:06:53,176 --> 00:06:54,931
Please take a look at our portfolio.

94
00:06:54,931 --> 00:06:58,893
And... please consider letting us
work with you.

95
00:06:58,893 --> 00:07:02,728
My friend is the best candidate,

96
00:07:02,728 --> 00:07:05,429
since he was able to save you like that.

97
00:07:07,529 --> 00:07:11,189
It's true. You could have been dead.

98
00:07:16,275 --> 00:07:20,296
You didn't know the stalker

99
00:07:20,296 --> 00:07:22,365
or had a deal with him before this, did you?

100
00:07:22,365 --> 00:07:24,813
That's right.

101
00:07:24,813 --> 00:07:27,485
We didn't know anything about the stalker.

102
00:07:27,485 --> 00:07:29,197
No! That's not what I meant.

103
00:07:29,197 --> 00:07:32,549
- I mean...
- Are you fucking serious?

104
00:07:35,608 --> 00:07:37,992
Please calm down.

105
00:07:37,992 --> 00:07:40,507
I mean it's hard to believe, right?

106
00:07:40,507 --> 00:07:43,649
A stranger risked his life to save me.

107
00:07:43,649 --> 00:07:47,877
You're talking about good things
like they're literally impossible.

108
00:07:47,877 --> 00:07:50,363
It's really strange.

109
00:07:50,363 --> 00:07:53,227
Listen, I don't know
how the hell you grew up.

110
00:07:53,227 --> 00:07:55,529
But honestly, I feel sorry for you

111
00:07:55,529 --> 00:07:58,469
if that's really how you see the world.

112
00:07:58,469 --> 00:08:01,029
Seriously, you think we're so pathetic

113
00:08:01,029 --> 00:08:04,992
that we do something that awful to you,
just to have you hire us?

114
00:08:04,992 --> 00:08:07,621
That's fucking ridiculous!

115
00:08:07,621 --> 00:08:09,159
Stop swearing, buddy.

116
00:08:09,159 --> 00:08:10,909
What did you just say?

117
00:08:10,909 --> 00:08:12,235
What did you say to me?

118
00:08:12,235 --> 00:08:13,600
I said

119
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:17,763
that my friend and I are not pathetic enough
to do something horrible like that,

120
00:08:17,763 --> 00:08:19,293
just to get you to hire us.

121
00:08:19,293 --> 00:08:23,224
I know you said more than this.
Spill it out, all of it!

122
00:08:23,224 --> 00:08:24,413
You really didn't get what is said?

123
00:08:24,413 --> 00:08:26,800
- Pun, please?
- Yeah, I didn't get it.

124
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,282
A Thai person who likes to speak English
when he's mad,

125
00:08:29,282 --> 00:08:30,965
people see that he has no manners.

126
00:08:30,965 --> 00:08:35,307
If you want to say bad things about me,
say it in Thai, say it!

127
00:08:35,307 --> 00:08:38,240
Fine, then listen to me.

128
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:41,621
I said that it is very strange

129
00:08:41,621 --> 00:08:45,280
that you questioned
about people doing nice things to each other.

130
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:48,746
I said I didn't know how you grew up,

131
00:08:48,746 --> 00:08:52,669
but I feel bad for you
for seeing the world like this.

132
00:08:57,861 --> 00:08:59,717
I'll go back to my room.

133
00:08:59,717 --> 00:09:01,227
You should get some rest.

134
00:09:01,227 --> 00:09:03,069
I'll be back tomorrow.

135
00:09:17,243 --> 00:09:18,607
Hey.

136
00:09:24,549 --> 00:09:26,229
Are you hungry?

137
00:09:26,229 --> 00:09:27,947
You want some rice
with chicken and gourd soup?

138
00:09:27,947 --> 00:09:30,539
I like gourd.

139
00:09:30,539 --> 00:09:32,340
Go ahead.

140
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,235
Pun.

141
00:09:39,429 --> 00:09:41,126
Pun.

142
00:09:47,203 --> 00:09:48,774
I'm sorry.

143
00:09:52,805 --> 00:09:54,606
I'm sorry, too.

144
00:09:57,174 --> 00:09:59,790
Seeing from your point of view,

145
00:10:00,899 --> 00:10:03,069
you're not wrong for thinking that.

146
00:10:08,537 --> 00:10:13,075
I understand
that the world isn't that wonderful.

147
00:10:15,269 --> 00:10:17,573
Well...

148
00:10:17,573 --> 00:10:21,291
can you tell me your strengths?

149
00:10:21,291 --> 00:10:22,963
And your friend's?

150
00:10:24,925 --> 00:10:26,925
Okay.

151
00:10:26,925 --> 00:10:30,509
Well, I'm a chef,
and I got a degree in Sports Nutrition,

152
00:10:30,509 --> 00:10:32,310
that is, nutrition and diet for athletes.

153
00:10:32,310 --> 00:10:34,459
I cook the best healthy dishes.

154
00:10:34,459 --> 00:10:39,456
I can make your body lean
while maintaining your curves with my food.

155
00:10:39,456 --> 00:10:43,808
80% of body sculpting is based on your food.

156
00:10:43,808 --> 00:10:45,629
I think you know that.

157
00:10:48,325 --> 00:10:50,576
Sounds interesting.

158
00:10:50,576 --> 00:10:54,096
My friend is a great personal trainer,
with great determination.

159
00:10:54,096 --> 00:10:57,549
He is not as famous as others,
but he's very focused on his work.

160
00:10:57,549 --> 00:11:01,389
Our skills can really benefit you.

161
00:11:03,145 --> 00:11:04,946
So?

162
00:11:08,340 --> 00:11:10,342
I'll think about it.

163
00:11:12,072 --> 00:11:14,309
Look, you don't have to hire me.

164
00:11:15,529 --> 00:11:18,852
But I think you should give Boat a chance.

165
00:11:20,024 --> 00:11:21,829
He's really good at this.

166
00:11:24,781 --> 00:11:26,869
I'll let you know tomorrow.

167
00:11:47,707 --> 00:11:50,549
I said I will tell you tomorrow.

168
00:11:53,419 --> 00:11:56,753
- Why are you following me?
- What?

169
00:11:56,753 --> 00:11:59,283
Nope, I'm not following you.

170
00:11:59,283 --> 00:12:01,109
My room is that way.

171
00:12:09,284 --> 00:12:11,085
Hello, Auntie?

172
00:12:11,917 --> 00:12:14,309
I'm doing fine, really.

173
00:12:14,309 --> 00:12:18,069
I'm strong like a superhero, don't you know?

174
00:12:20,117 --> 00:12:24,510
The nice guys saved me today,
they're so kind to me.

175
00:12:27,355 --> 00:12:30,675
You don't have to come and see me.
I'll be home tomorrow.

176
00:12:30,675 --> 00:12:32,466
Don't worry about me.

177
00:12:32,466 --> 00:12:34,669
How could I not worry about you?

178
00:12:34,669 --> 00:12:37,789
A man attempted to kill you?

179
00:12:37,789 --> 00:12:41,891
<i>And blood spilled all over your body
the other day.</i>

180
00:12:41,891 --> 00:12:44,227
You need to be sprayed with holy water.

181
00:12:44,227 --> 00:12:47,624
When you're free,
I will take you to a temple.

182
00:12:47,624 --> 00:12:48,949
Sure.

183
00:12:48,949 --> 00:12:51,765
I'll let you know when I am free.

184
00:12:51,765 --> 00:12:54,909
You should go to bed.
You need to wake up early tomorrow.

185
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:58,079
Okay.

186
00:13:12,584 --> 00:13:17,368
Domino, can you look at their portfolio
one more time?

187
00:13:17,368 --> 00:13:19,776
And check Boat's rate for me.

188
00:13:19,776 --> 00:13:22,109
Only Boat?

189
00:13:24,757 --> 00:13:28,773
He can barely move, he's like a robot.

190
00:13:30,032 --> 00:13:34,069
Fine, the other guy's rate too.
He's interesting.

191
00:13:34,821 --> 00:13:37,589
Got it. Both of them, right?

192
00:13:37,589 --> 00:13:39,725
Yes! Ouch...

193
00:13:41,749 --> 00:13:44,269
Sure, I'll handle it.

194
00:13:44,269 --> 00:13:46,070
Talk to you later.

195
00:13:51,229 --> 00:13:54,208
I'll look at your portfolio again

196
00:13:54,208 --> 00:13:56,373
and I'll push your profile first, okay?

197
00:13:56,373 --> 00:13:57,648
Thank you.

198
00:13:57,648 --> 00:14:00,112
- Have you come up with the rate yet?
- Yes, I have.

199
00:14:00,112 --> 00:14:02,443
I'll tell you the result later.

200
00:14:02,443 --> 00:14:04,789
Get some rest and get well soon.

201
00:14:04,789 --> 00:14:06,949
- Thank you.
- No problem.

202
00:14:06,949 --> 00:14:08,909
I'm sorry about this.

203
00:14:08,909 --> 00:14:10,645
It's okay.

204
00:14:10,645 --> 00:14:14,322
- I should go, bye.
- Talk to you later.

205
00:14:22,552 --> 00:14:26,632
Yes! We need the job, we will get the job.

206
00:14:26,632 --> 00:14:30,157
Please, holy spirits at the gym.
We've shed our blood in your territory.

207
00:14:30,157 --> 00:14:32,138
Give us a chance to wipe off that blood.

208
00:14:32,138 --> 00:14:36,589
We will do a great job, please.

209
00:14:51,144 --> 00:14:53,789
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

210
00:14:54,579 --> 00:14:57,749
You're up early? What's on your schedule?

211
00:14:57,749 --> 00:15:02,283
Yeah, I need to see people in my district.

212
00:15:02,283 --> 00:15:06,021
I want to see Eva if I'm done early.

213
00:15:06,021 --> 00:15:09,200
How is she? She must be terrified.

214
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:12,001
She was faced with both Ginny's case,
and being attacked.

215
00:15:12,779 --> 00:15:14,573
She handled it well.

216
00:15:14,573 --> 00:15:18,109
She was lucky that she wasn't really hurt.

217
00:15:18,949 --> 00:15:21,189
Someone was there to help her.

218
00:15:25,811 --> 00:15:29,997
Did Eva know about you and Ginny?

219
00:15:34,347 --> 00:15:36,224
I don't think so.

220
00:15:36,224 --> 00:15:37,720
Good.

221
00:15:42,022 --> 00:15:44,662
But I think the police know about it.

222
00:15:45,541 --> 00:15:47,146
Who?

223
00:15:48,843 --> 00:15:51,893
I'm not sure how much he knows.

224
00:15:52,539 --> 00:15:55,518
I know that there were clips
from Ginny's stalkers.

225
00:15:55,518 --> 00:15:58,130
They took videos of her all the time.

226
00:15:58,949 --> 00:16:02,442
The police wanted to ask me questions
about Ginny too.

227
00:16:07,469 --> 00:16:09,429
Give me the names.

228
00:16:14,309 --> 00:16:15,696
Okay.

229
00:16:38,021 --> 00:16:40,045
A little bit on this side.

230
00:16:42,856 --> 00:16:44,469
So green.

231
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:47,669
You have a green thumb, ma'am.

232
00:17:06,603 --> 00:17:09,404
Tell Weechai to come and see me.

233
00:17:29,912 --> 00:17:34,824
Tell your son not to bring any girls home.

234
00:17:34,824 --> 00:17:37,429
He couldn't get a room at a hotel?

235
00:17:41,187 --> 00:17:44,867
I saw two girls leaving his room.

236
00:17:44,867 --> 00:17:46,813
Two girls!

237
00:17:46,813 --> 00:17:49,029
Our house isn't a cheap roadside motel.

238
00:17:49,635 --> 00:17:51,669
I'll talk to him.

239
00:17:54,531 --> 00:17:57,129
Morning, fam!

240
00:18:02,472 --> 00:18:06,056
Stop right there. Don't come any closer.

241
00:18:06,056 --> 00:18:09,509
I don't know who you slept with last night,
but it's disgusting.

242
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:14,299
I told your dad to lecture you about

243
00:18:14,299 --> 00:18:17,109
bringing strangers back to our house.

244
00:18:18,357 --> 00:18:20,896
If your dad can't make you stop this habit,

245
00:18:20,896 --> 00:18:22,697
I will tell your girlfriend.

246
00:18:23,701 --> 00:18:25,408
Grandma!

247
00:18:25,408 --> 00:18:28,325
If she breaks up with you,

248
00:18:28,325 --> 00:18:31,131
don't bother bringing another girl home.

249
00:18:31,131 --> 00:18:33,749
Pie's parents are valuable to us,
in many ways.

250
00:18:33,749 --> 00:18:37,749
You shouldn't upset them by sleeping around.

251
00:18:38,357 --> 00:18:40,229
Wee! You, too.

252
00:18:43,829 --> 00:18:48,296
Supoj's daughter is a better match for you.

253
00:18:48,296 --> 00:18:51,589
You should stay away from Eva
and date her instead.

254
00:18:53,261 --> 00:18:56,696
I have my reason for dating Eva.

255
00:18:56,696 --> 00:19:02,069
We need more votes from the grassroots
and the middle class people.

256
00:19:03,011 --> 00:19:08,155
I can relate more to these demographics

257
00:19:08,155 --> 00:19:10,528
if I date Eva.

258
00:19:10,528 --> 00:19:13,499
Will you keep campaigning
for the rest of your life?

259
00:19:13,499 --> 00:19:15,989
You can break up with her
after you get the position.

260
00:19:16,965 --> 00:19:21,149
You can't be with her forever,
or you'll lose other chances.

261
00:19:23,175 --> 00:19:26,799
Wee is not someone's definite choice,
Grandma.

262
00:19:27,533 --> 00:19:29,709
He is even harder to catch than me.

263
00:19:32,096 --> 00:19:36,416
I was talking about
losing a chance with great women,

264
00:19:36,416 --> 00:19:39,870
not some easy women to sleep with.

265
00:19:41,496 --> 00:19:48,283
A woman whom you will marry,
needs to be accepted by me first.

266
00:19:48,283 --> 00:19:52,627
She will be your legal wife,
a mother of your children,

267
00:19:52,627 --> 00:19:54,869
and my great-grandchildren.

268
00:20:00,693 --> 00:20:03,189
You need to stop bringing
your sleeping partners here.

269
00:20:06,667 --> 00:20:11,413
We were not sleeping.
None of us got any sleep.

270
00:20:11,413 --> 00:20:12,992
This is not funny.

271
00:20:12,992 --> 00:20:15,989
People can't get in or out
of this house easily.

272
00:20:15,989 --> 00:20:20,512
When Grandma gets frustrated,
she'd nag me about Eva constantly.

273
00:20:20,512 --> 00:20:22,149
You need to stop.

274
00:20:22,149 --> 00:20:25,203
Even if Eva did nothing,

275
00:20:25,203 --> 00:20:27,235
she could never satisfy Grandma.

276
00:20:27,235 --> 00:20:29,400
It has nothing to do with me.

277
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,201
Please.

278
00:20:32,792 --> 00:20:36,149
Don't fucking mess with me.

279
00:20:42,613 --> 00:20:44,693
What the fuck are you talking about?

280
00:20:44,693 --> 00:20:47,755
I didn't even fucking mess with you.

281
00:20:47,755 --> 00:20:50,789
Me? Messing with you? You're delusional.

282
00:21:31,189 --> 00:21:32,750
Hello.

283
00:21:33,925 --> 00:21:36,147
Any news from the forensic team?

284
00:21:36,147 --> 00:21:37,955
<i>We haven't received any official report yet.</i>

285
00:21:37,955 --> 00:21:40,264
<i>They still need to run more tests.</i>

286
00:21:40,264 --> 00:21:45,029
<i>But I asked around
and they said she could have been drugged.</i>

287
00:21:48,037 --> 00:21:51,579
Make sure you get the footage
from surveillance cameras in the event.

288
00:21:51,579 --> 00:21:53,035
Get them all.

289
00:21:53,035 --> 00:21:54,512
Don't let the police find out about it.

290
00:21:54,512 --> 00:21:57,189
Let me know if you have any updates.

291
00:22:09,981 --> 00:22:10,861
Hello, sir?

292
00:22:10,861 --> 00:22:14,317
<i>I will transfer Ginny's case to someone else.</i>

293
00:22:14,317 --> 00:22:15,608
Someone else?

294
00:22:15,608 --> 00:22:16,629
Who are they?

295
00:22:16,629 --> 00:22:18,325
<i>They can work faster and close the case soon.</i>

296
00:22:18,325 --> 00:22:20,021
<i>This case is causing damage to many people.</i>

297
00:22:20,021 --> 00:22:22,003
- <i>They want it to finalize soon.</i>
- But sir.

298
00:22:22,003 --> 00:22:23,896
I wasn't too slow on this case.

299
00:22:23,896 --> 00:22:26,109
I am focusing on...

300
00:22:36,644 --> 00:22:38,635
Hello?

301
00:22:38,635 --> 00:22:40,909
Did you get the autopsy report of Ginny?

302
00:22:41,515 --> 00:22:44,672
Got it, I just want to know.

303
00:22:44,672 --> 00:22:47,491
My case got transferred,
so I've got free time.

304
00:22:47,491 --> 00:22:49,160
And it caught my attention.

305
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:51,165
Can you hurry up and send me the report?

306
00:22:51,165 --> 00:22:53,195
Please help me on this.

307
00:22:53,195 --> 00:22:54,996
Thank you.

308
00:22:59,877 --> 00:23:02,429
Your blood pressure is normal.

309
00:23:02,429 --> 00:23:04,230
Thank you.

310
00:23:12,595 --> 00:23:15,165
I'm so excited to meet you in person.

311
00:23:15,165 --> 00:23:17,509
Can I get a picture?

312
00:23:18,571 --> 00:23:21,637
I'm not quite ready for a photo, maybe later.

313
00:23:21,637 --> 00:23:23,035
Got it. Thanks anyway.

314
00:23:23,035 --> 00:23:25,989
The doctor will see you this afternoon.

315
00:23:31,187 --> 00:23:33,109
- Hello.
- Hello.

316
00:23:38,205 --> 00:23:41,749
I'm so bored, I want to go home.

317
00:23:41,749 --> 00:23:45,429
Sure. If the doctor says
you can be discharged, you can leave.

318
00:23:46,629 --> 00:23:47,813
Nice smile.

319
00:23:47,813 --> 00:23:49,163
Hey.

320
00:23:49,163 --> 00:23:51,760
About your personal trainer,
I checked their profiles.

321
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:52,816
Actually, they're not bad.

322
00:23:52,816 --> 00:23:56,269
The rate is more affordable
because they're not famous.

323
00:23:57,331 --> 00:23:58,397
More importantly,

324
00:23:58,397 --> 00:24:01,635
did you hear when Pun scolded us
in English fluently?

325
00:24:02,365 --> 00:24:04,120
Why?

326
00:24:04,120 --> 00:24:06,555
- What?
- Don't tell me...

327
00:24:06,555 --> 00:24:08,133
Yeah.

328
00:24:08,133 --> 00:24:11,189
Listen, he had lived overseas
since he was 16 years old.

329
00:24:11,189 --> 00:24:13,744
His accent is so cool.

330
00:24:13,744 --> 00:24:16,889
Also, he didn't look like the type
who'd chase the spotlight.

331
00:24:16,889 --> 00:24:20,589
So he likely won't use your photos
to promote his service.

332
00:24:23,565 --> 00:24:28,109
Do we really need to hire an English tutor?

333
00:24:29,149 --> 00:24:31,928
You need to imitate his accent.

334
00:24:31,928 --> 00:24:34,086
He can coach you how to say your lines.

335
00:24:34,086 --> 00:24:36,381
You can practice by speaking with him
for three months.

336
00:24:36,381 --> 00:24:39,475
To say it correctly.

337
00:24:39,475 --> 00:24:41,276
Eva.

338
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:46,171
You really need a tutor for this.

339
00:24:46,171 --> 00:24:49,935
I don't want any other tutors
to talk about this.

340
00:24:49,935 --> 00:24:53,375
It will be a juicy piece of gossip for sure.

341
00:24:54,267 --> 00:24:56,014
Fine.

342
00:24:56,014 --> 00:24:59,579
Can you ask him to see
if he's okay with this?

343
00:25:00,658 --> 00:25:03,127
Okay, my friend.

344
00:25:06,712 --> 00:25:09,317
- What?
- Your accent still hasn't improved.

345
00:25:09,317 --> 00:25:10,523
Mine is better than yours.

346
00:25:10,523 --> 00:25:14,029
If I didn't have so much work to do,
I could be your tutor instead.

347
00:25:18,475 --> 00:25:20,657
- Pun!
- Don't talk to me now.

348
00:25:20,657 --> 00:25:22,454
Pun! Boat!

349
00:25:26,529 --> 00:25:29,789
- You scared us!
- Well, you scared me too!

350
00:25:30,689 --> 00:25:32,619
Are you okay?

351
00:25:32,619 --> 00:25:33,709
You mean me or the floor?

352
00:25:33,709 --> 00:25:35,212
- The floor.
- The floor.

353
00:25:37,029 --> 00:25:38,989
He's funny, isn't he?

354
00:25:41,301 --> 00:25:43,104
I brought you some food.

355
00:25:43,104 --> 00:25:46,349
You must be sick of hospital food already.

356
00:25:46,349 --> 00:25:47,751
Thank you.

357
00:25:53,176 --> 00:25:55,949
Well, you shouldn't have.

358
00:25:55,949 --> 00:25:58,026
Thank you for bringing us food.

359
00:25:58,026 --> 00:26:01,112
- Go ahead.
- Let me see.

360
00:26:01,112 --> 00:26:04,867
Wow! Pizza.

361
00:26:04,867 --> 00:26:07,002
Normally, I don't eat carbs.

362
00:26:07,002 --> 00:26:10,174
- But?
- But I will eat it to show you.

363
00:26:10,174 --> 00:26:13,285
- Great.
- Let me see, which slice is the biggest?

364
00:26:13,285 --> 00:26:15,086
I'll get this one.

365
00:26:21,493 --> 00:26:23,229
Do you need some water?

366
00:26:23,229 --> 00:26:25,509
- Yeah, that sounds good.
- I'll get some.

367
00:26:25,509 --> 00:26:26,852
Thank you.

368
00:26:28,415 --> 00:26:33,429
Let's say, if I hire you to be my trainers,

369
00:26:33,429 --> 00:26:36,480
what will be your training plan?

370
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:38,281
Here's the plan.

371
00:26:39,285 --> 00:26:43,085
It's like you're hiring two personal trainers.

372
00:26:43,085 --> 00:26:45,624
I will focus on your workout plan,

373
00:26:45,624 --> 00:26:48,102
to build your strength, flexibility,

374
00:26:48,102 --> 00:26:51,925
and to get your body ready
for an action role.

375
00:26:51,925 --> 00:26:54,971
Pun will be your nutritionist.

376
00:26:54,971 --> 00:26:59,995
He can prepare your food
and design your diet plan.

377
00:26:59,995 --> 00:27:03,924
You can eat three meals
and two snack breaks per day.

378
00:27:03,924 --> 00:27:07,710
He can make really delicious healthy snacks.

379
00:27:13,389 --> 00:27:15,190
You can have a look.

380
00:27:18,208 --> 00:27:21,125
Okay, let me see. Thanks.

381
00:27:22,308 --> 00:27:27,320
We came up with a plan
for your training program,

382
00:27:27,320 --> 00:27:30,219
by combining with your diet plan

383
00:27:30,219 --> 00:27:32,800
to sculpt and nourish your body.
[7 Day Healthy Meal Plan]

384
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:35,171
This is a sample of 7-day meal plan.

385
00:27:35,171 --> 00:27:38,984
But I need to tell you that I'm very strict.

386
00:27:38,984 --> 00:27:40,344
When I train you,

387
00:27:40,344 --> 00:27:43,416
you need to believe me,
and listen to my instructions.

388
00:27:43,416 --> 00:27:45,355
And you can't be stubborn.

389
00:27:45,355 --> 00:27:48,224
I saw the plan that you followed earlier.

390
00:27:48,224 --> 00:27:50,816
I know that you eat food
that you're not supposed to.

391
00:27:53,197 --> 00:27:55,368
How did you know?

392
00:27:55,368 --> 00:27:58,069
Muscles don't lie.

393
00:27:58,069 --> 00:28:01,742
- Huh?
- I can tell from your muscles.

394
00:28:03,088 --> 00:28:06,904
Boat could let it slide, but I won't.

395
00:28:06,904 --> 00:28:09,687
I don't care if you will fire me.

396
00:28:09,687 --> 00:28:12,008
I don't care who you are.

397
00:28:12,008 --> 00:28:15,421
Your work is also my work.

398
00:28:15,421 --> 00:28:19,949
If you wish to hire me,
you can't go off track.

399
00:28:24,420 --> 00:28:26,934
Muscles don't lie.

400
00:28:28,599 --> 00:28:32,235
Domino, follow me.

401
00:28:32,235 --> 00:28:33,925
Okay.

402
00:28:33,925 --> 00:28:36,459
Domino?

403
00:28:36,459 --> 00:28:38,949
Right, your tablet.

404
00:28:39,624 --> 00:28:40,744
Hurry up!

405
00:28:40,744 --> 00:28:43,269
Okay, I'm coming.

406
00:28:47,843 --> 00:28:50,509
Hey. What do you think of them?

407
00:28:52,243 --> 00:28:54,165
I think they are honest.

408
00:28:54,165 --> 00:28:55,555
They don't look like
the attention-seeking type.

409
00:28:55,555 --> 00:28:57,088
And they're not cocky.

410
00:28:57,088 --> 00:29:00,781
I prefer them over the others

411
00:29:00,781 --> 00:29:04,320
because Pun can take care of my diet plan.

412
00:29:04,320 --> 00:29:08,909
And one more thing.
You want him to be my English tutor.

413
00:29:11,192 --> 00:29:13,669
Cool, shall we talk to them?

414
00:29:14,800 --> 00:29:16,266
Yeah.

415
00:29:17,152 --> 00:29:19,060
When Pun speaks,

416
00:29:19,060 --> 00:29:23,347
his accent sounds like
when Wee talked to his friends.

417
00:29:24,424 --> 00:29:26,291
I want him to teach me to speak like that,

418
00:29:26,291 --> 00:29:27,981
and understand what they say.

419
00:29:27,981 --> 00:29:30,603
Because I told Wee that I can speak English.

420
00:29:30,603 --> 00:29:32,165
Oh my goodness!

421
00:29:32,165 --> 00:29:35,325
That's so cool! You can speak too!

422
00:29:35,325 --> 00:29:37,144
What's wrong?

423
00:29:37,144 --> 00:29:38,179
That's the reason.

424
00:29:38,179 --> 00:29:41,555
It'd be nice if Pun agrees to be my tutor.

425
00:29:41,555 --> 00:29:44,568
I don't have to hire another tutor
and embarrass myself.

426
00:29:44,568 --> 00:29:45,819
The news won't leak,

427
00:29:45,819 --> 00:29:48,549
and nobody can start any rumors
that I'm not good at it.

428
00:29:48,549 --> 00:29:51,909
You're right, I got it.
Shall I talk to them now?

429
00:29:51,909 --> 00:29:53,163
Okay.

430
00:30:01,219 --> 00:30:03,171
Eva.

431
00:30:03,171 --> 00:30:05,485
Wee.

432
00:30:05,485 --> 00:30:08,269
I didn't expect you to come.

433
00:30:09,489 --> 00:30:13,035
Actually, my schedule was tight today,

434
00:30:13,035 --> 00:30:14,876
but I need to come and see you.

435
00:30:15,515 --> 00:30:17,264
I want to talk to you.

436
00:30:17,264 --> 00:30:20,412
I haven't taken care of you lately.

437
00:30:20,412 --> 00:30:24,669
And you kept encountering horrible incidents
one after another.

438
00:30:25,974 --> 00:30:27,664
It's totally fine.

439
00:30:27,664 --> 00:30:29,130
I understand.

440
00:30:30,027 --> 00:30:32,085
We should wait until
things cool off for a bit.

441
00:30:32,085 --> 00:30:36,149
I will make it up to you
until you get bored of me.

442
00:30:36,909 --> 00:30:38,710
I can't wait.

443
00:30:43,065 --> 00:30:46,744
I ran some background check
on the guys who saved you.

444
00:30:46,744 --> 00:30:50,189
They are clean
and you have nothing to worry about.

445
00:30:51,069 --> 00:30:52,976
That's great.

446
00:30:52,976 --> 00:30:55,269
Can I...

447
00:30:55,269 --> 00:30:58,340
Can I visit them?
I want to thank them in person.

448
00:30:59,271 --> 00:31:00,895
Sure.

449
00:31:12,011 --> 00:31:15,659
Thank you so much.

450
00:31:15,659 --> 00:31:20,990
This gift is nothing
compared to what you did for Eva.

451
00:31:20,990 --> 00:31:22,676
My friend should take all the credit.

452
00:31:23,544 --> 00:31:25,345
- No problem.
- Thank you.

453
00:31:27,091 --> 00:31:30,429
I heard that you just got back
from overseas, right?

454
00:31:31,765 --> 00:31:34,029
- Yeah.
- Where did you just get back from?

455
00:31:34,029 --> 00:31:35,624
New York, sir.

456
00:31:35,624 --> 00:31:37,789
New York, I see.

457
00:31:37,789 --> 00:31:41,254
Have you always been
a personal trainer since then?

458
00:31:41,254 --> 00:31:43,589
Not really. Actually, I was...

459
00:31:43,589 --> 00:31:44,980
Please excuse me.

460
00:31:49,483 --> 00:31:51,062
Hello?

461
00:31:52,281 --> 00:31:54,811
I see, alright.

462
00:31:54,811 --> 00:31:56,374
Got it.

463
00:31:57,168 --> 00:32:00,069
Okay, I will be there soon.

464
00:32:00,069 --> 00:32:01,460
Alright.

465
00:32:04,189 --> 00:32:06,819
I'm sorry, I really need to get back to work.

466
00:32:06,819 --> 00:32:09,608
Actually, I have meetings all day,

467
00:32:09,608 --> 00:32:11,488
but it was important for me
to come and see you.

468
00:32:11,488 --> 00:32:13,003
Thank you so much.

469
00:32:13,003 --> 00:32:16,229
- Thank you.
- Thank you so much.

470
00:32:22,309 --> 00:32:24,029
Eva.

471
00:32:24,029 --> 00:32:26,976
We will host a party tomorrow at home,

472
00:32:26,976 --> 00:32:30,080
and my dad would like you to join us.

473
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:31,808
Can you make it?

474
00:32:31,808 --> 00:32:32,912
Yeah.

475
00:32:32,912 --> 00:32:34,492
Are you sure?

476
00:32:39,435 --> 00:32:40,683
Thank you so much.

477
00:32:40,683 --> 00:32:42,856
I should get back to work.

478
00:32:42,856 --> 00:32:44,797
- Okay.
- I'll talk to you later.

479
00:32:45,491 --> 00:32:47,523
- See you later.
- See you later.

480
00:32:47,523 --> 00:32:49,413
- Bye.
- Bye.

481
00:33:02,966 --> 00:33:04,429
Sir?

482
00:33:04,429 --> 00:33:06,477
I will ask them to edit the videos
for the press,

483
00:33:06,477 --> 00:33:08,789
and select some photos for you to choose.

484
00:33:10,094 --> 00:33:12,987
What are some intriguing topics to pitch?

485
00:33:12,987 --> 00:33:15,997
For example, you feel really guilty
for being too focused in your work

486
00:33:15,997 --> 00:33:18,136
that you had no time to take care of Eva.

487
00:33:18,136 --> 00:33:20,600
I think you should find her a gift tonight

488
00:33:20,600 --> 00:33:23,349
and post it on
your personal social media account.

489
00:33:26,792 --> 00:33:29,069
Giving her a watch is also a good idea.

490
00:33:29,928 --> 00:33:32,749
We can focus on giving her "more time".

491
00:33:34,544 --> 00:33:36,145
Good, let's follow this plan.

492
00:33:36,145 --> 00:33:37,949
- Got it, sir.
- Good.

493
00:33:40,581 --> 00:33:43,989
Don't forget to edit his photos
before posting.

494
00:34:03,173 --> 00:34:04,731
Ms. Eva?

495
00:34:04,731 --> 00:34:06,229
Can I get a picture with you?

496
00:34:06,229 --> 00:34:07,819
Sure.

497
00:34:11,498 --> 00:34:14,005
One, two, three.

498
00:34:14,656 --> 00:34:16,457
Thank you.

499
00:34:18,208 --> 00:34:20,667
Hello, Weechana and Eva.

500
00:34:20,667 --> 00:34:22,629
- Hello.
- Hello.

501
00:34:29,203 --> 00:34:33,840
What did you talk about?
It seemed so much fun.

502
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:36,597
Eva just told us about shooting sets.

503
00:34:36,597 --> 00:34:38,288
I thought being a star should be easy,

504
00:34:38,288 --> 00:34:40,853
it turned out to be different than I thought.

505
00:34:40,853 --> 00:34:44,339
Eva is able to tolerate
hardships in her life,

506
00:34:44,339 --> 00:34:46,418
and I admire this trait about her.

507
00:34:46,418 --> 00:34:49,128
I praised her all the time
about how far she has come.

508
00:34:49,128 --> 00:34:52,329
She barely had anything in her life.

509
00:34:54,869 --> 00:34:58,309
Have you met Nicole, Supoj's daughter?

510
00:34:58,309 --> 00:35:00,989
She just graduated.

511
00:35:00,989 --> 00:35:03,904
She came back to Thailand
for less than a month,

512
00:35:03,904 --> 00:35:10,136
but foreign books and star agencies
already want her to join their team.

513
00:35:10,136 --> 00:35:14,389
If she becomes a star, Eva,
please take care of her.

514
00:35:16,520 --> 00:35:18,112
It will be my pleasure.

515
00:35:18,112 --> 00:35:20,749
Let me know if you need my help.

516
00:35:22,629 --> 00:35:27,549
Wee, can you introduce Nicole to Mr. Uthin?

517
00:35:28,336 --> 00:35:29,709
Okay.

518
00:35:29,709 --> 00:35:31,710
You should go with him.

519
00:35:36,843 --> 00:35:37,984
If you'll excuse me.

520
00:35:37,984 --> 00:35:40,269
Eva, please come with me.

521
00:35:47,720 --> 00:35:51,961
I heard that you will be starring
in a foreign film.

522
00:35:51,961 --> 00:35:53,853
That's right.

523
00:35:53,853 --> 00:35:55,859
It's a huge studio.

524
00:35:55,859 --> 00:35:57,757
They will shoot overseas
for 40% of the movie,

525
00:35:57,757 --> 00:36:00,256
and the rest will be shot in Thailand.

526
00:36:00,256 --> 00:36:03,648
Are you co-stars foreigners or Thai?

527
00:36:03,648 --> 00:36:04,827
Both foreigners and Thai.

528
00:36:04,827 --> 00:36:09,229
I see. Can you speak English with them?

529
00:36:10,117 --> 00:36:12,245
Yeah.

530
00:36:12,245 --> 00:36:15,003
I mean speaking fluently.

531
00:36:15,003 --> 00:36:19,001
Having basic conversation skills
doesn't count, you know?

532
00:36:19,829 --> 00:36:23,365
If you get the role
and you can't act that well,

533
00:36:23,365 --> 00:36:26,079
it will be really terrible.

534
00:36:27,531 --> 00:36:29,895
I will try my best.

535
00:36:31,406 --> 00:36:34,286
Let's get something to eat. I'm hungry.

536
00:37:00,783 --> 00:37:03,584
They look good together, don't you think?

537
00:37:05,901 --> 00:37:08,045
In what way?

538
00:37:08,045 --> 00:37:11,688
I think you know what I'm trying to tell you.

539
00:37:11,688 --> 00:37:18,120
Don't act so innocent, confused, easy, stupid,

540
00:37:18,120 --> 00:37:20,429
and ask me to repeat my question.

541
00:37:24,597 --> 00:37:26,923
I really don't know
what you're talking about.

542
00:37:26,923 --> 00:37:28,949
I am dating Wee.

543
00:37:29,925 --> 00:37:33,848
But you asked me
if they looked good together.

544
00:37:34,499 --> 00:37:39,029
So I need you to clarify it to me.

545
00:37:41,763 --> 00:37:44,344
Good evening, Ms. Jit.

546
00:37:44,344 --> 00:37:45,389
Good evening.

547
00:37:45,389 --> 00:37:47,528
- Eva, hello.
- Hello.

548
00:37:47,528 --> 00:37:50,013
Atchara, long time no see.

549
00:37:50,013 --> 00:37:51,381
Enjoy the party.

550
00:37:51,381 --> 00:37:52,807
Thanks.

551
00:37:59,504 --> 00:38:04,589
If you want to hear it directly,
loud and clear,

552
00:38:05,397 --> 00:38:07,198
then listen to me carefully.

553
00:38:10,037 --> 00:38:12,598
Did you see how perfect they look together?

554
00:38:12,598 --> 00:38:15,237
That's what I didn't see
when you two were together.

555
00:38:15,237 --> 00:38:17,776
If it is just dating,

556
00:38:17,776 --> 00:38:21,709
anyone can date him, including you.

557
00:38:23,237 --> 00:38:25,749
When he needs to be serious
in a relationship,

558
00:38:26,368 --> 00:38:28,989
not everyone can make the cut.

559
00:38:43,184 --> 00:38:45,864
You should leave Weechana.

560
00:38:45,864 --> 00:38:50,323
Otherwise, you will be exhausted,
and your effort will go to waste.

561
00:38:50,323 --> 00:38:52,389
Because I don't like you.

562
00:38:57,773 --> 00:39:00,829
I don't despise you or anything.

563
00:39:01,904 --> 00:39:05,189
I'm just trying to protect what I built.

564
00:39:06,346 --> 00:39:11,147
And I only select
what I think is the best choice,

565
00:39:11,147 --> 00:39:14,749
the perfect match for my people.

566
00:39:24,509 --> 00:39:28,045
It's like what you said to everyone.

567
00:39:28,045 --> 00:39:31,667
That I can tolerate hardships in life.

568
00:39:33,717 --> 00:39:36,260
I tell myself every single day

569
00:39:36,949 --> 00:39:41,629
how blessed I am
to be standing here right now.

570
00:39:43,711 --> 00:39:47,069
The others could be a better match for him
than me.

571
00:39:47,069 --> 00:39:52,301
But I will prove to you
why your grandson picked me.

572
00:39:55,756 --> 00:39:57,557
If you'll excuse me.

573
00:40:01,525 --> 00:40:05,069
I know that you're strong enough
to walk by yourself.

574
00:40:23,435 --> 00:40:25,389
Can I talk to you?

